  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-slippy-slide-skates-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "ff37072416b204b179de46a26ed96f9c8c5d09cf6bdb8d4b400d4c476f4170ba",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d292d18b6b5f39885776ab38c63285ad6ecfd91cc1c02cdfb127e7ff5d730d98",
      "text": "悟空\n学滑冰",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3776d96823356e2989e3b4630a123759e08d4078d1bf3333d0d2058da7fb681d",
      "text": "悟空看着大家滑来滑去。\n“哇，滑得像飞一样！\n我也想试试！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1fa07155b8fc307f8385be4aa7d917b66155b5f210f12d8d968c47db5d63b689",
      "text": "他穿上冰鞋。\n咚，咚，走两步。\n“咦，像踩着小雪橇！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "caf4a7684d235468687297a44a59e4f9311fadca65d5614aacac52574af7c186",
      "text": "戴好头盔，戴好手套。\n水獭教练检查好冰鞋。\n“准备好迈小步了吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a4d8b3e5130107c99a84015632ea23850fe0f63181d0a844d68f1ae77b6cac34",
      "text": "悟空走上冰面。\n两只脚滑开了。\n“哎哎，两只脚，别跑呀！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9d2c2c8149eac49b489807dd135017927929a42ac6b44e0d014a0654b4a67f4f",
      "text": "哎哟！他摔了一跤。\n一屁股坐在冰上。\n“屁股凉冰冰的！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a76e1fed5a893b0bc30a8da7dc1da9916de0d4767287d9796423d5339b57482e",
      "text": "“刚学都会晃，别着急。”\n水獭教练说，\n“来，我们一起站起来。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "42a8af1c4b9f3c53d3b7a10c60be69e4df210dbaee8891b4d0c0f34b595d1f77",
      "text": "迈小步，弯膝盖。\n“像小企鹅！”玉兔说。\n悟空一摇一摆，咯咯直笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2bc26bb1b78a1b6b9f013960ae34f5e9d6b73b879f8f89a9cac1277d2ff7f238",
      "text": "蹬……滑……\n蹬……滑……\n滑出去一点点！\n又滑出去一点点！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "249e8be433244037aef52ba67832235d059c242b7624a3534ca9bdbbe703a69b",
      "text": "接着，他又摔了一跤。\n“我还以为已经学会了呢。”\n他坐到八戒旁边。\n“和我一起歇歇吧。”八戒说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4611dcfaa10f8fe8c4b19279057b8390fa5a61ae3a7697d48243e9ee669c0a8b",
      "text": "他们搓搓小手，\n看雪花轻轻地转着圈。\n“我要再试一次。”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d96b72da4b4a0cc558712bad72d24d0be0edf11b2b9dd2e8c6456408d3bdf41",
      "text": "悟空回到冰上，接着练。\n迈一小步，滑一小下，\n摇摇晃晃也没关系。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0421d17bd015f3e759c1f13d588c77998a7846828d710030ccb061aac677d972",
      "text": "练着练着，\n悟空滑得越来越稳了。\n蹬一下，滑一段。\n“快看！我会滑啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b4bd5d30c29eca192ab676fe359f6268e554fd49c7b512f8ec4ef4f7a5839ba6",
      "text": "玉兔在前，八戒跟着，\n悟空也慢慢滑起来。\n三个人绕了个圈，\n一路笑个不停。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "80f699937c0b09cab1096205ab5862e835c76be023483a5fb3c092e4c05ae3f3",
      "text": "冰场的灯一闪一闪。\n悟空腿都酸了，\n脸上还乐呵呵的。\n“下次还来！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b0e0d972af21f1fcc51deec873ddc579383197753de0736d01749a8a7d3132ab",
      "text": "悟空钻进被子里。\n梦里，\n他滑过一颗颗星星，\n慢慢地，轻轻地，\n一直滑进梦乡。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
